    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ewalikinoto natawalikia Olaitoriani Habakuki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitashe nanu te rishata ai arripisho. Naton nanu to ltalet orripishoreki naing'orisho nanu, pee adol ina naajoki ninye nanu, o ina nawalu nanu tialo enking'unyung'uny ai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naawaliki nanu Olaitoriani ejo, “Ngero ena duaata; ngero mbalie too soito dapashi, pee etum akueta ilo oisum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 10.37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu eton ake eanyu enduaata enkata enye; kesieku ninye alotu erishata enye - nemelejisho ninye. Tenelioo ninye aa yietut, taanyu ninye, esipa kelotu ninye, meimutie ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 1.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilg 3.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 10.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ng'ura, ore ilo leme sidai oltau lenye, nemetum puan, kake ore ilo asipani eishu te nkirukoto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emutata e lelo arruok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake sii enkalejani enaisho; mebikoo ilo tung'ani oitokoos nelala olorok lenye eba anaa enemeneng'a; etiu anaa keeya meraposho ae kata. Eiturrurroki ninye kewan iloshon pooki neiturrur iloreren pooki anaa iltung'ana lenyena makewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aimeibelekenyakino kulo pooki ninye, neitalaku elap, nesukeny ninye ejo, “Woi ninye ilo osot ntokitin neme nkunenyena - ae te nkata nabaa ilo asotoki kewan elaakinoto oo silen.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aimedumunye lelo lintalak isilen nabo kata, ore lelo oodumunye nikinkirikirie iyie? Nilo iyie aaku oloyaruno te ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki nimbung'a araya iloshon kumok, eikimbung iyie aaraya ilo pisiai oleku loo ltung'ana te nkaraki osarge loo ltung'ana o larrabal te nkop, too nkanas e lelo pooki oomanya atua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninye ilo otum tumoto e ntorroni te nkaji enye, ilo oilepunye orreshet lenye, pee medoiki entorroni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpiraka iyie enkaji ino enkurruna, ore teine niwuang'ie iloreren kumok ninturrayie enkishui ino makewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu keishir osoit te suntai, neng'amaa iloom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninye ilo oshetu enkang to sarge, neitayu enkanasa te ntorroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura mme Olaitoriani loo lororani eing'uaa, nchere pee easisho iltung'ana te nkaraki enkima, neitanaur ilosho ate te mpesho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.11.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 11.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu keyookini aaiput enkop, te ng'eno e nkitoo o Laitoriani, anaa enaibulua enkare enaiposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninye ilo oitook ile latia enye, enkikompe e ngoro enye, neitemer ninche, pee etum atishila enkurruna enye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eikipuoi iyie aaishopoki esulare te rishata e nkitoo, tookisho iyie, niesiesari. Ore enkikompe natii enkaina e tatene o Laitoriani, naa keitamanuni aayau enitii, nelotu enkurruna shumata ekitoo ino! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olarrabal oitayioki te Lebanon naa eikimisie iyie; Ore enkidaata oo ng'uesi naa eikirutie iyie, te nkaraki ilo sarge loo ltung'ana o larrabal te nkop, nejing'aki nkanas o lelo pooki oomanya atua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaa dupoto eeta enkitanyaanyukoto e nkai, teneidip olaitobirani lenye aitobiru, enkitanyaanyukoto e nkai e sekenkei, olaiteng'enani le lejare? Amu keisilig oloasisho ina kitobirunoto naitobirua ninye, nemeitobiru ninye nkitanyaanyukot nemeiro! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woi ninye ilo ojoki enchata, inyo; nejoki osoit lemeiro, tudumunye! Ng'ura etumuraki ninye te sahabu o te nkosholai, kake metii enkiyang'et tukul atua ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etii Olaitoriani atua enkaji enye Sinyati; nchoo enkop pooki eitirring'a te dukuya ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
